  <td class="ln"><span class="tag pill-live">SURVIVED &mdash; the week's best-evidenced result</span>
      All six gates fired mechanically in their exact live config across the whole of this week's
      captured tape, every fire counted rather than only the ones near a big move:
      <strong>&minus;$1,905.36 on 117 fires</strong>, and <strong>&minus;$517.79 of that is the
