s="ln">Benched the short book at the European open before the 07:50 squeeze.</td></tr><tr class="row-hl"><td class="ln">08-19 07:50Z</td><td class="ln"><code>{&#x27;abs_veto_short&#x27;: &#x27;on&#x27;}</code></td><td class="ln">✅ GOOD</td><td class="ln">Re-armed for the down-leg it then caught (+$179 in claims at 13:50).</td></tr><tr class="row-bad"><td class="ln">08-19 12:40Z</td><td class="ln"><code>{&#x27;abs_veto_long&#x27;: &#x27;on&#x27;, &#x27;abs_veto_short&#x27;: &#x27;off&#x27;, &#x27;exhaustion_short&#x27;: &#x27;off&#x27;}</code></td><td class="ln">❌ BAD</td><td class="ln">Benched abs_veto_short and exhaustion_short ten minutes before the 13:39 down-leg that made the rider $541, and armed the LONG fader into it. Wrong side, wrong ten minutes.</td></tr><tr class="row-bad"><td class="ln">08-19 12:51Z</td><td class="ln"><code>{&#x27;grind_long&#x27;: &#x27;on&#x27;}</code></td><td class="ln">❌ BAD</td><td class="ln">Armed grind_long into the same down-leg. It could not fire — the ATR floor saw to that — so the cost is $0 and the process is still wrong.</td></tr><tr class="row-hl"><td class="ln">08-19 13:40Z</td><td class="ln"><code>{&#x27;grind_long&#x27;: &#x27;off&#x27;, &#x27;abs_veto_short&#x27;: &#x27;on&#x27;}</code></td><td class="ln">✅ GOOD</td><td class="ln">Corrected itself within the hour: grind off, short book back on, one minute after the rider's entry.</td></tr><tr class="row-bad"><td class="ln">08-19 13:41Z</td><td class="ln"><code>{&#x27;grind_long&#x27;: &#x27;off&#x27;, &#x27;abs_veto_long&#x27;: &#x27;off&#x27;, &#x27;abs_veto_short&#x27;: &#x27;on&#x27;}</code></td><td class="ln">⚠ CHURN</td><td class="ln">A second write 30 seconds after the first, same content plus abs_veto_long. Two writes, one decision.</td></tr><tr><td class="ln">08-19 13:50Z</td><td class="ln"><code>{&#x27;capitulation_long&#x27;: &#x27;off&#x27;}</code></td><td class="ln">&mdash; $0</td><td class="ln">Housekeeping on a gate that had not fired.</td></tr><tr class="