case, straight into three more stops. <strong>Re-arming without a positive live case is now this
gate's most expensive recurring pattern</strong>, and it has cost money on three separate occasions
that the ledger records.</p>

<h3>3 &middot; Is the router earning its keep? The mechanical counterfactual</h3>

<p>The honest way to ask is not &ldquo;did the benched gates lose money&rdquo;, because a benched
gate has no P&amp;L. Movement&nbsp;2 fires all six mechanically in their exact live config across
the whole of this week's captured tape &mdash; every fire counted, not just the ones near a big
move &mdash; which is the counterfactual this question needs:</p>

<table><thead><tr><th class="ln">Gate</th><th class="num">Live this week</th><th class="num">If it had been armed all week, mechanically</th><th class="num">Difference</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class="row-hl"><td class="ln"><code>grind_long</code></td><td class="num">benched, $0</td><td class="num">&minus;$319.17 on 11 fires</td><td class="num">$319.17</td></tr><tr class="row-hl"><td class="ln"><code>capitulation_long</code></td><td class="num">benched, $0</td><td class="num">&minus;$97.66 on 10 fires</td><td class="num">$97.66</td></tr><tr class="row-hl"><td class="ln"><code>abs_veto_long</code></td><td class="num">benched, $0</td><td class="num">&minus;$83.42 on 26 fires</td><td class="num">$83.42</td></tr><tr class="row-hl"><td class="ln"><code>rgv_short</code></td><td class="num">benched, $0</td><td class="num">&minus;$17.54 on 1 fires</td><td class="num">$17.54</td></tr><tr class="row-hl"><td class="ln"><code>exhaustion_short</code></td><td class="num">$144.50</td><td class="num">&minus;$638.02 on 18 fires</td><td class="num">$782.52</td></tr><tr class="row-hl"><td class="ln"><code>abs_veto_short</code></td><td class="num">&minus;$203.00</td><td class="num">&minus;$749.55 on 51 fires</td><td class="num">$546.55</td></tr></tbody><tfoot><tr><td class="ln"><strong>ALL SIX</strong></td><td class="num"><strong>&minus;$58.50</strong></td><td class="num"><strong>&minus;$1,905.36 on 117 fires</strong></td><td class="num"><strong>$1,846.86</strong></td></tr></tfoot></table>

<p class="ln">The tournament's live book was &minus;$58.50 this week. Firing the same six gates
mechanically through the same tape is <strong>&minus;$1,905.36 on
117 fires</strong>. On that comparison the standdown plus the
