g</strong></td><td class="ln"><span class="tag pill-parked">PARKED</span></td><td class="ln">It blocked 24,110 of 24,121 raw signals this week. Revive with the floor ladder proposed in Part 2.5 — this lab cannot say whether 22 is right, only that it binds almost everything.</td></tr></tbody></table></section>
