<p>On its generating sample the overnight leg looks strong: 396 trades, +$4,142, +0.444R, strip-best-3 still +$3,578, strip-best-10 still +$2,281, leave-one-day-out worst +$3,536, seven green months of ten, leave-one-<strong>month</strong>-out worst +$2,388, counter-trend control −$1,146. It also survives a full point of slippage each side.</p>
<p>So I did the clean thing available: <strong>the hypothesis was generated on the 236-session backfill, so the 28-session 5s lake is now a genuine held-out test for it.</strong> The roles reverse.</p>
