<h5>1. ★ INTERROGATE THE LABEL FIRST. This outranks anything built on top of it.</h5>
<p>Your standing rule, and it changes the whole question. <code>run_census.cluster()</code> is a four-branch waterfall and UNCLASS is the <em>else</em> clause:</p>
<pre><code>|flow z| &gt;= 1.0   (needs &gt;= 30 one-minute tick buckets in the trailing 2h)
