amp &gt; 0.30 %                 -&gt; VOL-EXPANSION
13 &lt;= hour &lt; 15              -&gt; OPEN/NEWS
otherwise                    -&gt; UNCLASS</code></pre>
<p>I ran that waterfall on <strong>every minute</strong> of the census window, not just the 68 run minutes.</p>
