<p><strong>The two legs give opposite answers.</strong> On the year leg the thrust trigger is worthless (F is <em>negative</em>) and the ER regime is everything (C ≈ A ≈ B, and D is its clean mirror). On the recent leg the ER regime alone loses money (C is negative) and the trigger is what earns (F positive). Neither component is stable, and a rule whose own decomposition inverts between two samples is measuring the sample, not the market.</p>
