<h5>6. MOMBRK — the best number on the page, killed hardest</h5>
<p>Built directly on §3.2's finding: <code>nt_z</code> is the strongest size discriminator and it strengthens with run size. So: arm on trade-count z, take the momentum side, break-entry.</p>
