<h6>1.2 ⚠ A landmine came with the backfill, and it will bite something</h6>
<p>Those <code>backfill_*.parquet</code> files were added to the lake since last Friday, and they sit in the <em>same directory</em> as the daily 5-second files. So a query that reads gold's bars without filtering the timeframe now silently unions 1-minute, 5-minute, hourly and <strong>daily</strong> bars into the same series. Take a <code>high</code> across that union and the 10:00 minute inherits the high of the day it is in.</p>
